{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a440d684a0a76e99590a091ff24113f542d916d15d1ec1f30809bc3dadf51999", "ja": "（曲の発売に合わせて、プロモーションを\n仕掛ける事になった。今日は瑞希のPV撮影だ）", "zh": "（配合歌曲发售，决定展开宣传活动。今天是瑞希的PV拍摄日。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "7feae111cf5f467ac4a1848e297465df304d3d3723a12af6c1eb952e0603f882", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようございます。\n今日は、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "{$P$}，早上好。\n今天也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "27fa9e23f079de58456a2d4f79d883828620bd59738b4702fc908568b27b8fd2", "ja": "ああ、おはよう、瑞希。\nもう衣装に着替えてたんだな。", "zh": "啊，早上好，瑞希。\n已经换好演出服了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "76175886d1f335de6fd638f6d2eec2c7e2b7ddab58e343362ede881ae919e99c", "ja": "はい。撮影が始まる前に、\nしっかりとイメージしておきたかったので。", "zh": "是的。因为我想在拍摄开始前，先好好构思一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "297ff5b769578eff36d6614b541df68de915d9f093629d857c030c1e7dc24be4", "ja": "{$P$}。今日の私は、一味違います。\nさて、どこが違うでしょう。", "zh": "{$P$}。今天的我，可不太一样。\n那么，你觉得是哪里不一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6872711eeff7995b3c5857b56a83f4e4733ef7a77269f2567e07b5ef3eaa2746", "ja": "え？　そうだな……。\nかなり気合いが入ってるように見えるけど。", "zh": "咦？这个嘛……看起来干劲十足呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b71ad3e5e9b7c2638cb1e7f075201369dcada27c02a6e7bb73ea5f2cb816678", "ja": "おお……さすがです、{$P$}。\nそうです。今日の私は、気合い十分。", "zh": "哦……不愧是您，{$P$}。\n没错。今天的我，干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "711e89a358edec7dfb58381b71655b6db5e4ec97b2241734ae8a572d5df80f63", "ja": "今回のプロモーションは、恋がテーマと聞きました。\n私、恋にはちょっとうるさいです。", "zh": "听说这次的宣传活动主题是恋爱。\n我对恋爱可是有点讲究的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6e080c65e225a754c98c9c1edc0838109f44ee5ac3634e39fc208186ad642b1f", "ja": "おお……なんだか自信がありそうだな、瑞希！", "zh": "哦……感觉你很有自信嘛，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "f558eb93a504d62b91de058d04404bf1d8b0623c2e2a41ff888f18e63b9be54c", "ja": "はい。今日の撮影のために、家で自主レッスンを\n重ねてきました。……イメトレは、バッチリ。", "zh": "是的。为了今天的拍摄，我在家里反复自主练习了。……想象训练也做得非常充分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c1972b44b2ad976ddc86b1e2194d497676a937403518201d69440b61e41a9fd2", "ja": "自主レッスン？", "zh": "自主练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "3be2a1e4007106b307e3dea2336933ad46b21c4cd50860bff605a076ef3dbde3", "ja": "はい。まずは徳川さんと秋月さんから、\n恋愛をテーマにした小説や漫画を借りました。", "zh": "是的。首先，我从德川小姐和秋月小姐那里借来了以恋爱为主题的小说和漫画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "8f2eaf1423f290404b4585c5af575ffce7ee4bc946db1004f5a57421580189bb", "ja": "それから馬場さんに、北米ドラマも少々。\n……大人の、恋愛シチュエーション。", "zh": "另外，我还向马场小姐借了几部北美电视剧。  \n……大人的恋爱场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "b444269d2b336b0cd507f0b6d7913fecc0de49e36e2e9ae0d91a7236e0e83c82", "ja": "今の私は、ただの瑞希ではありません。\n恋愛マスター瑞希、と呼んでください。……いぇい。", "zh": "现在的我，可不只是瑞希。\n请叫我恋爱大师瑞希。……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "24c86394e04f28c74f0b71215efa231430463e7f16daae217474ea93ce91c6b4", "ja": "そうか、熱心に準備してくれてたんだな。\nよし！　その調子で、みんなをトリコにしてくれ！", "zh": "这样啊，你一直在认真准备呢。\n好！就保持这个状态，把大家都迷住吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "eb360321bf3671f9a21209d0790b44cc712ac4f9dd7c2a2bb7416586fbb72beb", "ja": "はい、もちろんです。みんなをトリコに……\nみんなを？　……みんな？", "zh": "是的，当然。要让大家都为之着迷……\n大家？……大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3606f20364318c15ea5bd2906e2d8ecc42f7aa6ca73f58a519796f54f2012b6a", "ja": "あ、そろそろ時間だな。\n瑞希、向こうに行ってスタンバイを……。", "zh": "啊，差不多到时间了。\n瑞希，去那边准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "6afcac57a44c9354197e4db227bfbc75487e913f48fd7bff51adc3665d28eca7", "ja": "あ……待ってください、{$P$}。\n質問があります。", "zh": "啊……请等一下，{$P$}。\n我有个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "58dfa71391d7861b46d6d0bc0230b61129457560ba0e056520661c526d2e44c4", "ja": "みんなというのは、ファンのみなさんの事でしょうか。\nその場合、{$P$}は……？", "zh": "所谓的大家，指的是各位粉丝吗？\n那种情况下，{$P$}又算……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "14089cdb3a4c9f905956add88d6d42b1bf66a3e32f9d43510b37688d11d47533", "ja": "それなら、俺はとっくに瑞希のトリコだから\n心配しなくていいぞ。瑞希のプロデューサーだしな！", "zh": "既然如此，我早就已经是瑞希的俘虏了，所以不用担心。毕竟我是瑞希的制作人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "71737d933d2feb0020562dc4d4f108f910c438252553c1af7aecad502c356d19", "ja": "とっくに。私の。…………はっ。", "zh": "早就。是我的。…………啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "86421d95e15c14da17b691d9015dce6a561a097bf6715f3c464de5d73342fa45", "ja": "{$P$}。私の恋愛マスターとしての\nカンが告げています。今、いい写真が撮れそうだと。", "zh": "{$P$}。我作为恋爱大师的直觉告诉我，现在似乎能拍到一张好照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "c8e0a7e63d26692369fc21f1f79e04862107afce9ab7b2110777ddd17949d1e3", "ja": "では、行ってきます。\n……この感覚が、残っているうちに。早く。", "zh": "那么，我出发了。\n……趁这种感觉还留在心中。得快点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0174_1023_p", "source_sha256": "01dc037eb1dc4da3de5be2db5200f0882b2778b0e599c31c8b41abf45a8228f0", "ja": "（その後のPV撮影で瑞希が見せた表情は、撮影\nスタッフ達を唸らせた……やったな、恋愛マスター！）", "zh": "（之后的PV拍摄中，瑞希展现出的表情让拍摄工作人员们赞叹不已……干得漂亮，恋爱大师！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
